Hello everyone

To share an update on the negotiations. The privacy team:

* updated the DPA to clearly push back on the points we find not acceptable;
* added clauses to the DPA to safeguard the transfers outside of scope of the DPA - which are very general, and should cover us in case if Mehmet cannot confirm privacy safeguards for such transfers (as requested in my previous message);
* sent an email requesting Mazars confirmation of our updates, to finalise the negotiation asap.

CC [~accountid:638476d83e79f12e572272f3] with the feedback from Mazars, we would be able to finalise the DPA and conclude the negotiations.

