rehan.qadir: Got the culprit:
```    public static secondsToHours(seconds: number): number {
        return Math.ceil(seconds / (60 * 60));
    }```
When the pass is about to expire within 24 hours, we show expiration time in hours.
We don’t go into detail to show minutes.

And this `ceil` function round up the value to _1_

*Solution:*
We introduce the functionality to show expiration time in _minutes_ but this would require us to localise the string in all major languages.
I can make the changes, but the solution will only be reflected once the translations are done.

@aleksandra.saropova if you are aligned on the solution, please let me know, I will proceed with the development.

